# {{dist}}

A modeling-api model plugin, scaffolded by `mapi plugin init`.

- `src/{{module}}/model.py`: `GroupMeanModel` (`{{plugin_id}}`), a baseline
  `CustomModel` predicting each group's mean. Replace `fit` and `score` with your model.
- `tests/test_contract.py`: the contract kit (`mapi_sdk.testing.check_model`).

```bash
mapi plugin test            # run the contract kit locally
pip install -e .            # register the entry point (mapi.models)
mapi catalog models         # the plugin now appears in the local catalog
```

Use it from a spec:

```yaml
model:
  use: {{plugin_id}}@^0.1
  settings: {shrinkage: 0.1}
```
